# Wave W17-K (Lastlight Pass): pass turf — thin high-pass grass, pale grey-green and sparse over the stern shoulder, dry flecks and the odd bare-earth patch where the wind keeps it thin (design: calm speckled grass on a high mountain pass, the rock closing in). The Pass’s own ground — paler and thinner than Route 46’s wind-combed ridge grass, and greyer than Route 45’s ledged green.
